{"results": [{"name": "Poppi", "entity_id": "8D1C70F5-AECA-4309-8BBF-B2B5A5AEFE59", "types": ["urn:entity:brand"], "properties": {"akas": [], "description": "Poppi is a functional beverage brand that reimagined the traditional soda experience by infusing it with apple cider vinegar, prebiotics, and real fruit juices. Founded in a Texas kitchen, the brand has grown from local farmers' markets to a national presence, prioritizing gut health and low-sugar content without compromising on taste. It is widely recognized for its vibrant, clean aesthetic and significant social media influence. In 2025, the brand joined the PepsiCo family, further cementing its position as a major player in the evolving 'better-for-you' soda market.", "external": {}, "founded_year": "2015", "image": {"url": "https://images.qloo.com/i/8D1C70F5-AECA-4309-8BBF-B2B5A5AEFE59-420x-auto.jpg"}, "short_description": "Poppi is an American brand of prebiotic sparkling soda made with apple cider vinegar, fruit juices, and seltzer water, promoting gut health.", "short_descriptions": [{"language": "de", "value": "Ein präbiotisches Sprudelgetränk mit Fruchtsaft und Apfelessig, das eine gesündere, zuckerarme Alternative zu herkömmlichen Softdrinks bietet."}, {"language": "fr", "value": "Un soda pétillant prébiotique à base de jus de fruits et de vinaigre de cidre, conçu comme une alternative plus saine et faible en sucre aux boissons gazeuses traditionnelles."}, {"language": "es", "value": "Un refresco prebiótico con gas elaborado con zumos de frutas y vinagre de sidra de manzana, diseñado como una alternativa más saludable y baja en azúcar a los refrescos tradicionales."}, {"language": "en", "value": "A prebiotic sparkling soda made with fruit juice and apple cider vinegar, designed to provide a healthier, low-sugar alternative to traditional soft drinks."}]}, "popularity": 0.3335, "disambiguation": "", "tags": [{"name": "Food & Beverage", "tag_id": "urn:tag:genre:brand:food_and_beverage", "type": "urn:tag